### Pattern: Validation Table Brute-Force
If input is compared against a hardcoded table after transformation:
1. Extract expected values from .rodata/.data.rel.ro
2. If transform function is in a .so, call via ctypes directly
3. For short inputs (≤5 bytes), brute-force with seed/hash filtering
